OL,3,GNEWSALandlord loses licence after
OL,4,Arenting out flat despite fire risks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Glasgow landlord has lost their
OL,7,Flicence after renting out a property
OL,8,Fdespite the flat being a fire risk.
OL,10,FAn inspection of the Sauchiehall Street
OL,11,Fflat by firefighters found a series of
OL,12,Fissues, including some fire doors not
OL,13,Fdoors closing fully within their frames
OL,14,Fand extraction fans covered with dust
OL,15,For grease.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
