OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSALandlord loses licence after
OL,4,Arenting out flat despite fire risks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,7,Frefused to sign off an application from
OL,8,FAnna McMullan to renew a HMO (house in
OL,9,Fmultiple occupation) licence, which is
OL,10,Fneeded when a property is let out to
OL,11,Fthree or more people who are not
OL,12,Frelated.
OL,14,FGlasgow's licensing committee turned
OL,15,Fdown the application at a meeting
OL,16,Fearlier this week, saying a "a
OL,17,Fsubstantial fire risk" remains within
OL,18,Fthe property.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
